		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obfnd_oder_004r" title="(고유)해외파생 해외손익현황4" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="375" _ulen="283" >

FNCD^펀드코드^4^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
